# Components

~8 primitives consuming tokens. Names match `handoff/reference/styles.css`.

## 1. `<Mast>`

- Wordmark: `▮ riphone` (`::before` in accent; no SVG)
- Nav: `/latest`, `/archive`, `/feed.xml`
- `aria-current="page"` on active link
- 2px ink underline; 40px margin-bottom

## 2. `<PageGrid>`

- `200px 1fr`, 56px gap; collapses at 720px (sidebar `order: 2`)

## 3. `<Sidebar>`

- Mono 12px, meta color; labeled lists (`Recent`, `Tags`, etc.)

## 4. `<Post>`

- Dateline + title (+ `★` when `star: true` on originals)
- `.post + .post` hairline separator
- Serif body; blockquotes: 2px accent left rule

## 5. `<ArchiveRow>`

- `[56px date][1fr title][auto tag]` — mono, uppercase tag

## 6. `<RateRow>` / 7. `<AvailabilityCal>` / 8. `<CTA>`

- Reserved for `/sponsor` when enabled; page is off in v1. See `handoff/PAGES.md`.

## Reusability

New UI → existing primitives + tokens first. New component → document here
before building.
